cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the manuscript below."
type: software
title: "circular_ST: Circular Data Analysis for Spatial Omics"
abstract: >-
  R code for circular data analysis in spatial omics, reproducing the case
  studies of derived circadian peak phase in a mouse model of Alzheimer's
  disease and latent cell-cycle position in human ovarian cancer.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
